    {
      "flavor_text": "あるあさ　とつぜん　ふってくる。\nオニスズメに　おそわれると　はっぱを\nはげしく　ふって　おいはらう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "어느 날 아침 갑자기 떨어진다.\n깨비참에게 습격당하면 잎사귀를\n세차게 흔들어서 쫓아 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il tombe du ciel soudainement. S’il est attaqué par\nun Piafabec, il secoue violemment ses feuilles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Manchmal fällt es plötzlich vom Himmel. Wird es\nvon Habitak angegriffen, schüttelt es seine Blätter.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede caer del cielo de repente. Si le ataca un\nSpearow, moverá violentamente sus hojas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Piomba dall’alto improvvisamente. Se è attaccato\nda uno Spearow, agita violentemente le foglie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It may plummet from the sky. If attacked by a\nSpearow, it will violently shake its leaves.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ある朝　突然　降ってくる。\nオニスズメに　襲われると　葉っぱを\n激しく　振って　追い払う。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede caer del cielo de repente. Si le ataca un\nSpearow, moverá violentamente sus hojas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はっぱの　うらがわに　たまった\nあさつゆ　だけを　のんで　くらす。\nほかには　なにも　たべないという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "나뭇잎의 뒷면에 모인\n이슬만을 먹고 산다. 그 밖에는\n아무것도 먹지 않는다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vit en buvant la rosée sur les feuilles. On dit qu’il ne\npeut rien avaler d’autre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ernährt sich ausschließlich von den Tautropfen,\ndie von den Blättern über ihm hinabfallen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se alimenta del rocío que hay sobre las hojas de las\nplantas. Dicen que no come nada más.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive nutrendosi delle gocce di rugiada che cadono\ndalle foglie delle piante. Pare che non mangi altro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It lives by drinking only dewdrops from under the\nleaves of plants. It is said that it eats nothing else.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "葉っぱの　裏側に　たまった\n朝露だけを　飲んで　暮らす。\n他には　なにも　食べないという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se alimenta del rocío que hay sobre las hojas de las\nplantas. Dicen que no come nada más.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
